nary, 1,584 cases (5 strings × 11 index values incl. `INT_MIN`/`INT_MAX`/`-1`/`0`/boundary/past-end, all NULL-pointer combinations), linked against the C `.so` then the Rust `.so` via `LD_LIBRARY_PATH`. Both produced 33,586 bytes and `cmp` reports **byte-identical** output, covering all three error messages, empty-line output at `start == len`, and full-string output.\n\n`cargo build --release` compiles with no errors or warnings."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":737,"cache_read_input_tokens":24900,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":737,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":5,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"1316c7cd-8264-46a3-9cef-aeec74102a09","uuid":"f03fcfbd-157c-44c9-99b8-00ce9a6a9be0","timestamp":"2026-08-17T15:52:34.593Z"}
